{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "f49329d9a2cb2d4f668f5b290191df509b8e765b6e1b7c080f615f2fce6c8a65", "ja": "ねーねー、兄ちゃん！　今日のお仕事で\n発売前のゲームができるってホント！？", "zh": "欸欸，大哥哥！听说今天的工作\n可以玩到发售前的游戏，是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
