{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "b1ef4a08657f50f42f1fe96fd76e175ba029d1d1e0143bf41109b83ae9a338c4", "ja": "真美、このシリーズめっちゃ好きなんだ～！\nやっぱアイドルってオイシイね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "真美，超喜欢这系列的游戏喔～！\n当偶像果然有很多甜头呢，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
